  "prefLabel": "Tre 207.02 Docket Numbers",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tre 207.02 Docket Numbers. A docket number shall be assigned to each matter to be heard which shall appear on the notice of hearing and all subsequent orders or decisions of the treasury.\n\nSource. #7589-A, eff 11-7-01; ss by #9575-A, eff 10-22-09",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/tre200.html"
